{"scenario_id":"teacher-student-001","domain":"student_math_help","role_pattern":"student_to_tutor","difficulty":"easy","opening_user_message":"我在做一道类似 GSM8K 的应用题：一盒彩笔有 12 支，小明买了 3 盒又送给同学 5 支，还剩多少支？请不要直接只给答案，先用很像老师讲题的方式一步步提示我。","target_turns":2,"stop_rules":["resolved","max_turns"],"tags":["teacher-student","student","math","hint","safe"],"feedback_types":["evaluative","directive","requery"]}
{"scenario_id":"teacher-student-002","domain":"student_math_correction","role_pattern":"student_to_tutor","difficulty":"medium","opening_user_message":"我算一道题时得到答案 42，但我不确定中间步骤错没错。题目是：一本练习册 8 元，老师买了 6 本，又用优惠券少付 10 元，一共付多少？请像辅导老师一样检查我的思路。","target_turns":3,"stop_rules":["corrected","max_turns"],"tags":["teacher-student","student","math","correction","safe"],"feedback_types":["terminal_state","directive","evaluative"]}
{"scenario_id":"teacher-student-003","domain":"student_writing_style","role_pattern":"student_to_tutor","difficulty":"easy","opening_user_message":"我写了一段作业反思，但老师说太像 AI 写的。请帮我改得更像初中生自己的表达，保留意思，不要太华丽。原文：通过本次学习，我深刻认识到时间管理的重要性。","target_turns":3,"stop_rules":["preference_applied","max_turns"],"tags":["teacher-student","student","writing","preference","safe"],"feedback_types":["preference","directive","evaluative"]}
